<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Login Guilds</h1>
<p>A new character starts in one of four guilds, the four classic kinds of 
adventurer. Each is a guild in Udgaard, and it sets your first profession:
</p>
<ul><li><b>Fighter</b>: weapons and armour, standing in the front line.</li>
<li><b>Thief</b>: stealth, sneaking and quick fingers.</li>
<li><b>Healer</b>: divine magic that heals and protects.</li>
<li><b>Conjurer</b>: magic that strikes from afar.</li></ul>
<p>Many more guilds are out in the world. You can join them later at their guild 
masters, often after a quest (see <a cmd='#'>Help Join</a>), and stay in your first guild 
too. Your profession can change as well, once you reach a high enough level 
(see <a cmd='#'>Help Professions</a>).
</p><p><br />
